  "meta": {
    "about": "SolidCraft only. A 16 mm six-sided die: a cube intersected with a sphere for the classic rounded corners, then 21 pips cut as spheres with opposite faces adding to seven. Exports STL and 3MF for the slicer, STEP for CAD, two renders, and the measured volume so you know how much filament it takes. Change the size or pip radius in the nodes.",
    "tags": [
      "3d-print",
      "games"
    ],
    "title": "A die you can 3D print"
  },
